  "details": "Hello. Found a problem when creating the world.\nThe default graphics settings in Unity (low, good and others) are different from those used in VR Chat. Because of this, it is not possible to adjust elements such as LOD, the distance to draw shadows and other options. Please add the ability to edit the “Desktoplow”, “VRHigh” and “VRLow” settings in the SDK.\nThank you for your project.\n \n(sorry for the language, used the translator)",
